# Lever on: the piston extends at t=3 (repeater), the sensor goes active for 30gt, then cools
# down 10gt. Lever off after that: the repeater's power is gone 4gt later, but the sensor heard
# the flip (active at t+2) and holds the piston until t+31; it retracts at t+32.
design designs/gadgets/sculk-hold-cm.txt
probe p 2 1 0
probe s 2 0 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace p rrEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE
use 0 1 0
expect_trace p EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE~~rrrr
